			],
			"Message": "Refactor documentation to replace em quad characters with HTML entities for better visibility and consistency across multiple files. Update Markdown rendering logic to preserve em quad characters during text processing. Introduce new scripts for managing repository transfers between organizations, including functionality for listing forks and transferring documentation repositories. Enhance README with updated links and formatting.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "b9306309eec99ddea2a5e0ffa7337cef80cec54c"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
