			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				146,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Dependency and Element submodules to latest upstream revisions\n\nUpdate the Dependency submodule to advance Tauri's PluginsWorkspace and TauriSearch submodules. PluginsWorkspace reformats HTML permission reference tables across dialog, fs, log, and shell plugins from expanded multi-line format to consistent flat tab-indented structure. TauriSearch fixes malformed markup in seven pattern guide test fixtures (bridge.md, cloudbridge.md, cloudish.md, glui.md, hermit.md, lockdown.md, multiwin.md) by adding missing closing </rater> tags.\n\nUpdate the Element submodule across Cocoon, Mountain, SideCar, and Wind. Cocoon performs routine regeneration updating RouteManifest timestamp and rebuilding all compiled artifacts across bootstrap, effect, service, handler, gRPC, and dual-track layers. Mountain completes parking_lot migration for ApplicationState and command modules, replacing std::sync::Mutex and tokio::sync::RwLock with parking_lot equivalents across 20+ state modules (Debug, Decorations, Diagnostics, Documents, Keybindings, LifecyclePhase, Markers, NavigationHistory, OutputChannels, TreeViews, Webviews, WorkingCopy), removing poison-error boilerplate and simplifying lock acquisition. SideCar adds missing trailing newlines to Cache.json for POSIX text file compliance. Wind applies automated formatting to generated Effect-TS service interfaces and ESBuild configs, regenerates 200+ service interfaces from VS Code upstream sources, and updates CommandCatalog with 6,600+ new command entries (ServiceCatalog version 2026-06-05).\n\nAll changes maintain API compatibility with no breaking changes. Keeps the Land editor's dependency tree aligned with upstream improvements.",
